  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Technical Assistance to the Ministry of Finance, Tanzania Revenue Authority, President&apos;s Office - Regional and Local Government, Regional Administrations  is a component of Strengthening Public Financial Management in Tanzania reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xA3;3,237,637. It works in the following sector(s): Public finance management (PFM), Domestic revenue mobilisation, Environmental policy and administrative management.</narrative>
